tant worlds in documentaries produced by Escape to Nature. \nHere, you get a unique opportunity to have a look on projects aimed at saving the nature especially the underwater world thanks to work done by the team of filmmakers, photographers and scientists from around the world.\n\n", "short_description": "This is the first touch of amazing virtual word - Victoria VR.\n\nVisit our virtual gallery to discover the exciting journey of Escape to Nature.\n\nIt was possible to discover distant worlds in documentaries produced by Escape to Nature. \nHere, you get a unique opportunity to have a look on projects aimed at saving the nature especially the underwater world thanks to work done by the team of filmmakers, photographers and scientists from around the world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://victoriavr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://victoriavr.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Victoria VR, a.s.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://victoriavr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE", "TRAVEL", "ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "688790182531615"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3048511945470553"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3048511945470553"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1631140440, "status":